    {
      "id": "u_557a6bb357041c6e82304875_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Markdown notes can be converted to Text Notes with negligible loss of formatting fidelity.",
      "sourceHash": "557a6bb357041c6e8230487583a0556f43eaba92d5f4a84f026aaa1fe733579f",
      "context": "Converting between note types > Converting individual notes > Markdown to Text Note",
      "contextHash": "7a89e0a57740845425ac5e4aa3566f35762f5ca27cfaa5b00ee482d95e1fbc8f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_08057cea9b172f20fd1f9ae0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To do so, go to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Advanced__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_4__Convert to text note__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "08057cea9b172f20fd1f9ae0d32ccbe13649bf9510dda24a0863226b13a9d8b6",
      "context": "Converting between note types > Converting individual notes > Markdown to Text Note",
      "contextHash": "7a89e0a57740845425ac5e4aa3566f35762f5ca27cfaa5b00ee482d95e1fbc8f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_624871e2cefc77646c57c930_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Text Note to Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "624871e2cefc77646c57c930c21f095765b658102ca99ae36e8227f1d71dfe64",
      "context": "Converting between note types > Converting individual notes > Text Note to Markdown",
      "contextHash": "c4ea53f4441adb740121485e57a0fc87244a398ee24da4a65ada3e910081489a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5740d43c473204d1a3335e48_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since Markdown does not support all the capabilities of Text notes, this conversion is lossy in terms of formatting: some formatting may be lost, and some unsupported elements may even be dropped. It's strongly recommended that you inspect the content for any information that might have gone missing after the conversion.",
      "sourceHash": "5740d43c473204d1a3335e48b1d4e4f152dc2c9fdf5d6dc24edc9beb6c3dd0d2",
      "context": "Converting between note types > Converting individual notes > Text Note to Markdown",
      "contextHash": "c4ea53f4441adb740121485e57a0fc87244a398ee24da4a65ada3e910081489a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c037a147064801ec4e508455_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To convert a text note to Markdown, go to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Advanced__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_4__Convert to Markdown note__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "c037a147064801ec4e508455c91087e5f97e9f08e3f39db4c92af58bab8b6019",
      "context": "Converting between note types > Converting individual notes > Text Note to Markdown",
      "contextHash": "c4ea53f4441adb740121485e57a0fc87244a398ee24da4a65ada3e910081489a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
